# Octopus Form on an attacking Ornithopter (a tapped 0/2 flier): the creature gets +1/+1 (1/3), gains hexproof and is untapped, so
# it deals 1 damage as a 1/3. Bot2's Lightning Bolt cannot target it for the rest of the turn (the refusal, CR 702.11b), and on Bot2's own
# turn, once "until end of turn" has ended, the same Bolt can (the positive control): the Ornithopter is a 0/2 again and dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Octopus Form
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Octopus Form.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Hexproof
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 19
? Bot1.Graveyard = Octopus Form
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Octopus Form
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Life = 19
